// Latin from batch/passages1162.json (extract.js on sall.1, bare section digits
// already turned into **n.**). Three things the page needs, all declared:
//  - 15: the page numbers BOTH of the last two sections "4"; the second is 5
//    in every edition (Perseus included), so `fix` renumbers that marker only.
//  - 20: the speech opens each of its paragraphs with a double quote and closes
//    only at the end, the Iugurtha page's habit. sall.1 now joins
//    `_paragraphQuotes` in sources.json and the quotes go with `fix`, as in Iug. 85.
//  - 22: the page prints the editor's daggers round a corrupt word as plus
